Package: rodeo
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6
Maintainer: Your Name <you@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/lordgreg/rodeo
Description: A dual-pane terminal file manager with Vim-style keybindings
 Rodeo is a terminal file manager inspired by Norton and Midnight
 Commander, written in Rust. It pairs the classic dual-pane layout with
 Vim-style keybindings, a rich preview, and themes — with no runtime
 dependencies beyond a terminal.
